      "description": "Catheter Introducer Sheaths introduce various cardiovascular catheters through the interatrial septum into hard-to-reach sites in the heart. Sheaths enhance the clinical capability for transseptal punctures, cardiac mapping and therapeutic ablations in the left atrium or ventricle. Catheter Introducer Sheaths can typically be found in EP or Cath labs. Stryker’s Sustainability Solutions offers steerable sheaths only.",
